fice bunt","sacrifice fly","sacrifice hit","sacrificeless","sacrifice zone","salary sacrifice","self-sacrifice","supreme sacrifice","ultimate sacrifice","resacrifice","sacrificable","sacrificeable","sacrificed","sacrificer","sacrificing","sacrificingly","self-sacrificing","unsacrificeable","unsacrificed","unsacrificing"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sacrifice#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:9168263c1a25301ac0","definition":"To celebrate Holy Communion or Mass.","example":"For what power but God's can make good the promise of tendering the Body and Blood of Christ, as a visible mean^([sic]) to convey His Spirit? And he that goes about to make this change by consecrating the eucharist, must needs be understood to acknowledge this power of God's; but this is not that acknowledgment, which sacrificing importeth, but that, which every act of religion implieth. He that sacrificeth, acknowledging that which he sacrificeth, with all that he hath, to [come from or belong to]^([sic]) God, to testify this acknowledgment, abandoneth that which he sacrificeth to be destroyed in testimony of it.","pos":"verb","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"broadly, figuratively","register":"broadly, figuratively, intransitive","wordFamily":["human sacrifice","nonsacrifice","presacrifice","pseudosacrifice","sac","sacrifice area","sacrifice bunt","sacrifice fly","sacrifice hit","sacrificeless","sacrifice zone","salary sacrifice","self-sacrifice","supreme sacrifice","ultimate sacrifice","resacrifice","sacrificable","sacrificeable","sacrificed","sacrificer","sacrificing","sacrificingly","self-sacrificing","unsacrificeable","unsacrificed","unsacrificing"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sacrifice#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}],"pronunciation":{"ip